span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span></strong> <a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/railway-icf-trade-apprentice-recruitment-2025/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Railway ICF Trade Apprentice Recruitment 2025</strong></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download RRB NTPC UG CBT-I Admit Card 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id=\"1y1r3hu\" data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"256\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Visit the <strong>official website</strong> of your regional</span><br data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"214\"><strong><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Railway Recruitment Board</span></span></strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1yo5jgi\" data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"360\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">On the homepage, click on</span><br data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"289\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"292\" data-end=\"360\">“CEN (NTPC) Under Graduate Level Admit Card 2026”</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hfwgx7\" data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"407\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">You will be redirected to the login page</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1x3uqxe\" data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"499\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Enter your details:</span>\n<ul data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"499\">\n<li data-section-id=\"14ghz4q\" data-start=\"